6. Dealing with Politically Exposed Persons;  
7. Dealing with Correspondent Banks;  
8. Data Collection on money transfer;  
9. Record keeping;   
10. Reporting;  
11. Reporting of Suspicious Transaction Reports;  
12. Applying Provisional Measure; 
13. Confidentiality.

